    {
      "source": "The current release train version is <code>2026.0.0</code>. The train version uses <a href=\"https://calver.org/\">calver</a> with the pattern <code>YYYY.MINOR.MICRO</code>.\nThe version name follows <code>${calver}</code> for GA releases and service releases and the following pattern for all other versions: <code>${calver}-${modifier}</code>, where <code>modifier</code> can be one of the following:",
      "translation": "当前发布列版本为<code>2026.0.0</code>。该版本采用<a href=\"https://calver.org/\">calver</a>，模式为<code>YYYY.MINOR.MICRO</code>。  \nGA 发布和服务发布的版本号遵循<code>${calver}</code>，而其他所有版本则遵循以下模式：<code>${calver}-${modifier}</code>，其中<code>modifier</code>可以是以下之一：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>M1</code>, <code>M2</code>, and so on: Milestones",
      "translation": "<code>M1</code>、<code>M2</code> 等：里程碑",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>RC1</code>, <code>RC2</code>, and so on: Release candidates",
      "translation": "<code>RC1</code>、<code>RC2</code> 等：发布候选版本",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "You can find a working example of using the BOMs in our <a href=\"https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-data-examples/tree/main/bom\">Spring Data examples repository</a>. With that in place, you can declare the Spring Data modules you would like to use without a version in the <code>&lt;dependencies /&gt;</code> block, as follows:",
      "translation": "您可以在我们的<a href=\"https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-data-examples/tree/main/bom\">Spring Data 示例仓库</a>中找到使用 BOM 的可用示例。在此基础上，您可以在<code>&lt;dependencies /&gt;</code>块中声明希望使用的 Spring Data 模块，而无需指定版本，如下所示：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Boot selects a recent version of the Spring Data modules for you. If you still want to upgrade to a newer version,\nset the <code>spring-data-bom.version</code> property to the <a href=\"#dependencies.train-version\">train version and iteration</a>\nyou would like to use.",
      "translation": "Spring Boot 会自动为您选择一个较新版本的 Spring Data 模块。如果您仍希望升级到更新的版本，请将<code>spring-data-bom.version</code>属性设置为<a href=\"#dependencies.train-version\">您想要使用的训练版本和迭代版本</a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Due to the different inception dates of individual Spring Data modules, most of them carry different major and minor version numbers. The easiest way to find compatible ones is to rely on the Spring Data Release Train BOM that we ship with the compatible versions defined. In a Maven project, you would declare this dependency in the <code>&lt;dependencyManagement /&gt;</code> section of your POM as follows:",
      "translation": "由于各个 Spring Data 模块的发布日期不同，它们大多具有不同的主版本号和次版本号。查找兼容版本的最简单方法是使用我们提供的 Spring Data Release Train BOM，其中已定义了兼容的版本。在 Maven 项目中，您可以在 POM 文件的 `<dependencyManagement>` 部分声明此依赖，如下所示：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>SNAPSHOT</code>: Current snapshots",
      "translation": "<code>SNAPSHOT</code>：当前快照",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "See Spring Boot’s <a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-boot/docs/current/reference/html/dependency-versions.html#appendix.dependency-versions.properties\">documentation</a>\n(search for \"Spring Data Bom\") for more details.",
      "translation": "有关更多详细信息，请参阅 Spring Boot 的<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-boot/docs/current/reference/html/dependency-versions.html#appendix.dependency-versions.properties\">文档</a>（搜索\"Spring Data Bom\"）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The current version of Spring Data modules require Spring Framework 7.0.8 or better. The modules might also work with an older bugfix version of that minor version. However, using the most recent version within that generation is highly recommended.",
      "translation": "当前版本的 Spring Data 模块需要 Spring Framework 7.0.8 或更高版本。这些模块也可能与该小版本的旧版修复版本兼容，但强烈建议使用该代中的最新版本。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
